{
  "uid": "yeshua-deploy",
  "title": "Yeshua - Acompanhamento de deploy",
  "description": "Checkpoints do executor oficial, sem orquestracao Grafana. Filtre requestId para correlacionar estado, SHA, duracao, heartbeat e erros. Dados atrasados nao confirmam falha.",
  "id": null,
  "version": 1,
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "editable": false,
  "tags": [
    "yeshua",
    "deploy",
    "operational"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "environment",
        "label": "Ambiente",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "Production",
        "current": {
          "text": "Production",
          "value": "Production"
        },
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false
      },
      {
        "name": "execution",
        "label": "Execucao (requestId)",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": ".*",
        "current": {
          "text": ".*",
          "value": ".*"
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "module",
        "label": "Modulo",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "host,shared,central,clinica,aps-adm,fiscal,memorias,presenca,gateway",
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Estado atual, etapa, modulo e SHA",
      "type": "table",
      "description": "**O que mede:** Ultimo evento global da execucao (o filtro de modulo atua nos detalhes): status, modulo, etapa, SHA, timestamp UTC e elapsedSeconds. Escolha uma execucao para acompanhamento individual.\n\n**Como interpretar:** Consulte status e timestamps; ausencia de heartbeat pede investigacao, sem confirmar falha. O recibo persistido do MCP continua autoritativo quando a telemetria faltar.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "{service_name=\"yeshua-deploy\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$environment\"} | json | requestId=~\"$execution\" | event!=\"output\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "maxLines": 1
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "extractFields",
          "options": {
            "source": "Line",
            "format": "json",
            "replace": true,
            "keepTime": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Heartbeat ausente durante execucao (segundos)",
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "**O que mede:** Idade da ultima observacao somente para destinos em execucao. Mais de 45 segundos sinaliza observacao atrasada; nao declara falha.\n\n**Como interpretar:** Agregado por dimensoes estaveis; nao seleciona uma execucao individual. Use logs para requestId e SHA.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 45
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "values": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "(time() - max by (environment, target) (yeshua_deploy_heartbeat_seconds{environment=~\"$environment\"})) and on (environment, target) (yeshua_deploy_state{environment=~\"$environment\"} == 0)",
          "queryType": "range",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Timeline de checkpoints por execucao",
      "type": "table",
      "description": "**O que mede:** Sequencia UTC das etapas reais, com requestId, modulo, etapa, resultado, exitCode e durationSeconds. A tabela mostra ate 500 checkpoints na janela.\n\n**Como interpretar:** Consulte status e timestamps; ausencia de heartbeat pede investigacao, sem confirmar falha. O recibo persistido do MCP continua autoritativo quando a telemetria faltar.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "{service_name=\"yeshua-deploy\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$environment\"} | json | requestId=~\"$execution\" | module=~\"$module\" | event=~\"step_started|step_completed|step_failed|finished\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "maxLines": 500
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "extractFields",
          "options": {
            "source": "Line",
            "format": "json",
            "replace": true,
            "keepTime": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Duracao por modulo e etapa",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "**O que mede:** Duracao observada da ultima etapa por modulo e resultado; nao soma gauges nem usa IDs como labels.\n\n**Como interpretar:** Agregado por dimensoes estaveis; nao seleciona uma execucao individual. Use logs para requestId e SHA.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "max by (module, stage, result) (yeshua_deploy_duration_seconds{environment=~\"$environment\",module=~\"$module\"})",
          "queryType": "range",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Historico de conclusoes e SHA",
      "type": "table",
      "description": "**O que mede:** Conclusoes reais do script: sucesso/falha, SHA do checkout, duracao total, exitCode e requestId. Succeeded significa saida zero, nao homologacao funcional.\n\n**Como interpretar:** Consulte status e timestamps; ausencia de heartbeat pede investigacao, sem confirmar falha. O recibo persistido do MCP continua autoritativo quando a telemetria faltar.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "{service_name=\"yeshua-deploy\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$environment\"} | json | requestId=~\"$execution\" | event=\"finished\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code",
          "maxLines": 500
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "extractFields",
          "options": {
            "source": "Line",
            "format": "json",
            "replace": true,
            "keepTime": true
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Sucessos e falhas na janela",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "**O que mede:** Quantidade de eventos finais por resultado; reexportacao apos confirmacao perdida pode duplicar eventos. O recibo e a fonte para contagem exata.\n\n**Como interpretar:** Consulte status e timestamps; ausencia de heartbeat pede investigacao, sem confirmar falha. O recibo persistido do MCP continua autoritativo quando a telemetria faltar.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 18,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (count_over_time({service_name=\"yeshua-deploy\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$environment\"} | json | requestId=~\"$execution\" | event=\"finished\" [$__interval]))",
          "queryType": "range",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Logs correlacionados por requestId",
      "type": "logs",
      "description": "**O que mede:** Ultimas linhas sanitizadas de stdout/stderr. Linhas sensiveis sao ocultadas antes da persistencia/exportacao; nao inclui payload ou comando completo.\n\n**Como interpretar:** Consulte status e timestamps; ausencia de heartbeat pede investigacao, sem confirmar falha. O recibo persistido do MCP continua autoritativo quando a telemetria faltar.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "{service_name=\"yeshua-deploy\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$environment\"} | json | requestId=~\"$execution\" | module=~\"$module\" | event=\"output\"",
          "queryType": "range",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "title": "Erros e etapa com falha",
      "type": "logs",
      "description": "**O que mede:** Falha confirmada pelo exit code, com etapa/modulo e duracao. Consulte tambem a saida sanitizada para diagnostico; um heartbeat atrasado nao entra nesta lista.\n\n**Como interpretar:** Consulte status e timestamps; ausencia de heartbeat pede investigacao, sem confirmar falha. O recibo persistido do MCP continua autoritativo quando a telemetria faltar.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 27,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "enableLogDetails": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "{service_name=\"yeshua-deploy\", deployment_environment_name=~\"$environment\"} | json | requestId=~\"$execution\" | module=~\"$module\" | event=~\"step_failed|finished\" | exitCode != 0",
          "queryType": "range",
          "range": true,
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "links": [],
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  }
}
